# What a Codex host must not read out of this repository.
#
# Not a scanner suppression: the plugin scanner's verdict ignores repository-owned
# config by default, and it should. This is the narrower thing it is named for —
# local artefacts and machine state that are not part of the plugin and would only
# mislead a model reading the tree.

# Local project state, per-machine and per-session.
.great_cto/
.claude/worktrees/
node_modules/
dist/
coverage/

# Anything that carries a real credential. Nothing here is committed; the entry
# exists so an accidental one is not read either.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets.env
*.pem
*.key

# Build and test output.
tests/baselines/*.png
docs/screenshots/*.png
*.tgz
*.log
